{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And he shall flay the burnt-offering.</b> Since we find regarding the bulls and goats that are burned, that all of them are burned — skin, flesh, and dung — it is written regarding the burnt-offering: even though it is burned, it nonetheless requires flaying. [And he shall cut it into pieces — the way of the offerings is to cut them into pieces.]"], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:32.861659412Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}